00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:43.780
Looking at the origin of the Ted Kord Blue
Beetle might offer some clues for the villain

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:51.310
this season too.

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:55.670
Ted Kord became Blue Beetle after Daniel Garrett
died in battle. They were investigating Ted

00:02:55.670 --> 00:03:00.260
Kord's uncle Jarvis Kord. He was trying to
build an army of androids to take over the

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:01.170
